WHY ACCURACY ALONE IS MISLEADING HERE:
  The dataset is imbalanced: only 26.5% churned.
  A lazy model that predicts 'No churn' for everyone would score
  ~73% accuracy while catching ZERO churners.
  So we must also report Precision, Recall and F1-score.

