--- SECTION 14/15: L1 & L2 REGULARIZATION EXPERIMENTS ---
Regularization strength 1e-4 is small enough not to cripple learning
but large enough to penalize large weights on 46 features / 4900 rows.
nn_l1: train_loss=0.4178 val_loss=0.4419 TEST={'accuracy': 0.7877, 'precision': 0.6573, 'recall': 0.4179, 'f1': 0.5109}
