--- SECTION 16: RIDGE & LASSO (CLASSICAL LINEAR MODELS) ---
Ridge = linear model + L2 penalty. Lasso = linear model + L1 penalty.
These are NOT the same thing as NN L1/L2 penalties, but the idea
(punish large weights) is the same family of techniques.
Ridge  TEST: {'accuracy': 0.7791, 'precision': 0.6026, 'recall': 0.4929, 'f1': 0.5422}
Lasso  TEST: {'accuracy': 0.7839, 'precision': 0.6262, 'recall': 0.4607, 'f1': 0.5309}

